## Features

### Documentation Agent

- Upload and query PDF, DOCX, XLSX, TXT, LOG, and image files.
- Retrieve relevant document sections with RAG.
- Answer questions about:
  - ISO8583 fields and values
  - response codes and reject codes
  - HSM command documentation
  - technical functions from XLSX/PDF documentation
  - concepts, sections, procedures, and examples
- Preserve references to documents, pages, sheets, and paragraphs.
- Support conversation memory for follow-up questions.

### Log Analysis Agent

- Parse transaction traces deterministically.
- Extract:
  - MTI
  - FLD 002, 003, 037, 039
  - functions / Log Story
  - status OK, ERROR, UNKNOWN
  - HSM interactions
  - documented inconsistencies
- Display structured transaction cards.
- Generate PDF, TXT, and JSON reports.
- Link HSM and anomaly explanations to source documentation when available.

