## Architecture Overview

### Document Ingestion

```text
Upload
-> extraction_service.py
-> document_service.py
-> MongoDB
   -> documents
   -> document_sections
   -> document_content_units
   -> document_facts
   -> function_catalog
```

The ingestion layer extracts text, tables, sections, metadata, function rows, and structured content when available.

### Documentation Agent

```text
Question
-> conversation memory
-> intent / context resolution
-> retrieval
-> evidence / synthesis
-> normalized structured response
-> AIResponseCard
```

The Documentation Agent should use the conversation memory only to resolve context.

```text
Memory resolves context.
Documentation establishes facts.
Evidence controls generation.
```

### Log Analysis Agent

```text
Trace upload
-> deterministic parser
-> transactions
-> functions
-> HSM blocks
-> documented inconsistencies
-> structured response
```

The parser extracts technical data before the LLM explains it.
